{
  "summary": "This experiment tested transformer aggregation with pca_n2000 in a multiprofile RNA-only setup, aiming to assess if transformer aggregation's benefits (observed with scvi_n200) generalize. Validation accuracy of 0.5191 is lower than RNA-only baselines using scvi_n200 (0.6501) and avgpool (0.5907), suggesting potential limitations of transformer aggregation with pca_n2000. The role of RNA encoder choice and other uncontrolled factors remains uncertain without direct comparison to alternative configurations."
}

